and version, both generated at build time.


FFmpeg, which this image does NOT contain
-----------------------------------------

Gufo invokes ffmpeg/ffprobe as separate executables for video and audio
output. It does not link FFmpeg, and text serving never calls it. This image
installs no FFmpeg executable, library or package, and the build and CI gate
both assert that. Gufo's retained FFmpeg license texts
(third-party/ffmpeg*.txt) ship because Gufo's install rules copy the whole
licenses/ directory; they describe software that is not present. Media
endpoints fail in this image by design.


