Model artifacts, which this image does NOT contain
--------------------------------------------------

The image ships no weights. The artifacts it is built to serve carry their own
terms, and those terms follow the weights rather than this image:

    Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GGUF, UD-Q4_K_XL (four shards)
      unsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF
      license_name qwen-community-1.0
      https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF

    MTP draft head
      MTP/mtp-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-shared-Q8_0.gguf, from the same repository.
      Gufo uses the shared head, unlike vulkan-qwen4exp.

Intended serve command (bake-off; not exercised in CI, which has no GPU):

    gufo serve --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 llm \
      --model <UD-Q4_K_XL shard 1> \
      --speculative mtp --mtp-model <mtp-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-shared-Q8_0.gguf> \
      --sessions 2 --context 262144
